WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.170
I've said this before,

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:02.360
but I really believe our show

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.040
has the greatest fans in the world.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.260
Our fans are incredibly
funny and creative,

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.010
as they've demonstrated again
and again over the years.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.830
That's why tonight I'm
very excited to announce

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.570
we are asking our fans to produce

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.840
an entire episode of our show

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.520
that we're calling Do It Yourself Conan.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.687
(construction sounds)

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.310
It's the perfect project to help

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.690
get you through these pandemic times.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.500
I mean, why waste time
learning another language

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.540
or how to paint or play the piano

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.900
or figure out a way to
stop global warming,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:40.130
when you can spend your time
creating an episode of Conan?

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.530
Here's how Do It Yourself Conan will work.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.760
We're gonna post a special
Conan episode online.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.070
Your job is to pick one or more clips

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:50.920
from that episode and
recreate them from scratch.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.330
The only rule: be creative.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.760
Let your imaginations run wild.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.190
We did this a few years
ago, it was a huge hit.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.286
Here are just a few
examples from that show.

00:01:01.286 --> 00:01:03.869
(upbeat music)

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:10.643
Really amazing.

00:01:10.643 --> 00:01:13.050
In fact, I'm not sure why we never switch

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:15.400
to an all animated robots format.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.840
I really don't know.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.350
Just to whet your appetite,

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:20.150
one of the clips you'll get to recreate

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:21.360
is the now-famous moment

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.228
our associate producer
Jordan Schlansky said,

00:01:24.228 --> 00:01:27.525
Then I prepared my body in various ways.

00:01:27.525 --> 00:01:28.936
(laughter)

00:01:28.936 --> 00:01:31.060
I cleaned it, I shaved it.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.290
That's right.

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.560
Now you'll get the chance to recreate

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.850
Jordan Schlansky in various ways.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.990
So again, have fun, be as
creative as you can be,

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.830
while of course following all
the current pandemic rules

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.390
for staying safe and healthy.

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:46.750
Then we'll take our favorite entries,

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.460
sew them together into
one incredible program

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.840
which will air during our
regular time slot in the Fall.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.593
DIY Conan is being brought
to you by Snickers.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.120
And thanks to our sponsor,

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.940
there are some incredible
prizes you can win including,

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:06.360
I'm sure it's just a
coincidence, probably,

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.070
a year's supply of Snickers!

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.190
(intense guitar music)

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.950
You didn't see that coming, did ya?

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:11.833
Cha-ching!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:18.040
So go to teamcoco.com/diyconan
for all the details.

